# Canvas ↔ Preview WYSIWYG

Campaign pages must look the same in GrapesJS canvas and Preview (`/subscription` shadow).

## Do

- Put shared runtime CSS only in `flowRuntimeCss.js` (`FLOW_RUNTIME_CSS`, `FLOW_HOST_CSS`, `RESPONSIVE_STYLE_RULES`).
- Inject that bundle in live `shadowDom.js` and shared pieces in `canvasEnhancements.js`.
- Heal/sanitize in-card CTAs on save (`healFlowButtonsInEditor` + `sanitizeSavedPageHtml`) and on live mount (`healLiveFlowButtons`).
- Mark real image overlays with `data-tc-absolute="1"` (or hotspot). Never rely on bare `position:absolute` + px.

## Don't

- Add canvas-only or preview-only layout CSS that changes button/card geometry.
- Force `.flow-page-inner { width: 100% !important }` (breaks customWidth frames).
- Force `display:flex` on `.page-wrapper` / first child (rewrites author layouts).
- Treat bare `position:absolute`+top/left as intentional overlay without `data-tc-absolute`.

## Verify

Run: `npm test -- --run tests/unit/wysiwygContract.test.js`
